Multirow is a small package that was described in the LaTeX Companion =
(pages 135-136). Recently it has been updated by

Piet van Oostrum. There are also two companion files, bigdelim.sty and =
bigstrut.sty. You can find these files on any CTAN=20

node in the directory macros <ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/macros/> =
/latex <ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/macros/latex/> /contrib =
<ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/> /supported =
<ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/supported/> =
/multirow =
<ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/macros/latex/contrib/supported/multirow/>=
 =20

More about CTAN nodes is at the URL http://www.ctan.org =
<http://www.ctan.org/> . You can, e.g., get the files from the DANTE =
CTAN node=20

at ftp://ftp.dante.de/tex-archive/ in the directory indicated above. =
Good luck. Michel Goossens

